<title>PHILIPPINES: Davao Union Q1 net 95.328 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Davao Union Q1 net 95.328 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Davao Union Cement Corp posted a net income of 95.328 million pesos in the first quarter of its current fiscal year ending September 30, the Philippine Stock Exchange said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>No comparative figures were available.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36</p>
</text>
